# Gitignored files a NEW worktree needs to run, copied from the checkout it
# was created from. Read by Claude Code (`--worktree`, subagent and desktop
# worktrees) and by the Codex app (Codex-managed worktrees); `.gitignore`
# syntax, and only files that are ALSO gitignored are copied, so a tracked file
# is never duplicated. `bun run worktree:provision` covers every other kind of
# worktree (orchestrated, `git worktree add`) and copies the same files.
#
# Shared with the team: list only what a fresh worktree cannot rebuild. Add a
# project-only line below the shipped ones; the updater delivers this file once
# and never overwrites it.

# Values every harness launch and every MCP loader read.
.env
# Claude Code's generated env block (`bun run harness:env`).
.claude/settings.local.json
# OpenCode `{file:}` values and the curl token from `bun run api:login`.
.auth/**
# The synced OpenAPI spec: the OpenAPI MCP exits at start without it when
# OPENAPI_SPEC_PATH points here (`bun run api:sync` rebuilds it).
api/openapi.json
